as beira-saloia","Nightfall Attic":"Ilunabarreko ganbara.","Lights Down":"Argiak itzali.","Star Charts":"Izarren grafikoak","Quiet Steps":"Urrats lasaiak.","Midnight Snack":"Gauerdiko janaria.","The Small Hours":"Ordu txikiak","Lamp Lore":"Lanpararen historia.","Whispered Stories":"Istorio xuxurlak","Night Watch":"Gaueko Guardia.","Mastery: Nightfall Nocturne":"Gauez gauez.","Porcelain Gala":"Porzelanazko gala","White Gloves":"Eskularru zuriak.","Seating Plan":"Eserlekuen plana","The Set Pieces":"Puntuak","Polished Routine":"Errutina polita","Signature Service":"Sinadura Zerbitzua","Full Dance Card":"Dantza-txartel osoa.","The Grand Tour":"Bira Handia","Encore":"Berriz ere.","Mastery: Porcelain Gala":"Maitasuna: Porzelana Gala","Cozy":"Erosoa.","Standard":"Estandarra","Tricky":"Zaila da.","A tighter house with a move limit.":"Etxe estua mugimendu mugatuekin.","An open house with no limits.":"Etxe ireki bat mugarik gabe.","One shared house for everyone, today only.":"Etxe bat denontzat, gaur bakarrik.","One house, one seed, everyone ranked on the same terms.":"Etxe bat, hazia, denak maila berean.","Tea for Two, Quickly":"Tea birentzat, azkar.","Two and a half minutes on the clock. Speed adds to your score.":"Bi minutu eta erdi falta dira. Azkartasunak zure puntuazioa handitzen du.","A proper tea break where the kettle lives.":"Tea hartzeko atsedenaldi egokia.","Otto and the Bread Basket, together at last.":"Otto eta ogi-saskia, azkenean elkarrekin.","Pieces in at least 3 rooms.":"Piezak gutxienez 3 gelan.","Ten Moves, No More":"Hamar mugimendu, ez gehiago","Every move counts. Plan the whole story before you touch a piece.":"Mugimendu bakoitzak balio du. Planifikatu istorioa pieza bat ukitu aurretik.","Pip and the Old Clock share a moment.":"Pipek eta Erloju Zaharrak une bat partekatzen dute.","Read where the shelves are.":"Irakurri apalategiak non dauden.","Create 3 different kinds of story moment.":"Sortu 3 mota desberdinetako istorio momentuak.","Just the Two of Us":"Biok bakarrik.","A tall narrow house, two old friends, and their favorite things.":"Etxe altu eta estua, bi lagun zahar eta haien gauza gogokoenak.","Luna and the Telescope.":"Luna eta Teleskopioa.","Biscuit and the Ball of Yarn.":"Gailetatxoa eta Harizko Bola.","Luna and Biscuit share a room.":"Luna eta Gailetak gela berean bizi dira.","The Grand House Call":"Etxe Handiko deialdia","Visit every room before the visit is over.":"Bisita amaitu aurretik, joan gela guztietara.","Pieces in at least 5 rooms.":"Piezak gutxienez 5 gelan.","Mabel and the Potted Fern.":"Mabel eta lapikoetako erbinudea.","Record at least 4 story moments.":"Grabatu gutxienez 4 istorioaren uneak.","Signature Evening":"Sinadura gaua","Five friends, five favorites. Match them all.":"Bost lagun, bost gogokoenak. Denak bat.","Pip and the Old Clock.":"Pip eta Erloju Zaharra.","Create 4 different kinds of story moment.":"Sortu 4 mota desberdinetako istorio momentuak.","The Grand Gala":"Gala Handia","Everyone is invited. The house must shine in a handful of moves.":"Denak daude gonbidatuta. Etxeak distira egin behar du mugimendu gutxi batzuekin.","Pieces in at least 6 rooms.":"Piezak gutxienez 6 gelan.","Create 5 different kinds of story moment.":"Sortu 5 istorio mota desberdin.","Record at least 8 story moments.":"Grabatu gutxienez 8 istorioaren uneak.","Music where the guests gather.":"Musika gonbidatuak biltzen diren lekuan.","Welcome to your storyhouse. Let us give Pip a spot in the Kitchen.":"Ongi etorri zure etxetxoa. Utz dezagun Pipek toki bat sukaldean.","Select Pip on the tray, then choose a glowing spot in the Kitchen.":"Aukeratu Pip platerean, eta gero aukeratu puntu dirdiratsu bat sukaldean.","Well placed! Now save the scene to finish your first story.":"Ondo kokatuta! Orain gorde eszena zure lehen istorioa bukatzeko.","A Proper Cup":"Kopatxo egokia","Pieces come alive together. Let us make a story moment.":"Piezak elkarrekin bizitzen dira. Egin dezagun istorio bat.","Place Otto in the Kitchen.":"Jarri Otto sukaldean.","Place the Teapot in the Kitchen too.":"Jarri teontzia sukaldean ere.","Now make a moment: choose Interact with Otto and the Teapot selected.":"Orain hartu une bat. Aukeratu \"Interakzio bat Otto-rekin\" eta \"Teontzia\" aukeratu.","A tea break! Save the scene to keep it.":"Tea hartzeko atsedenaldia! Gorde eszena.","Tea tastes best in the Kitchen.":"Teak sukaldean du zapore onena.","Moving Day":"Mugimendu eguna","Stories change. Pieces can move rooms or return to the tray.":"Istorioak aldatzen dira. Piezak gelak mugitu ditzakete edo erretiluetara itzuli.","Place Mabel anywhere in the house.":"Jarri Mabel etxearen edozein lekutan.","Now move Mabel to a different room — drag her, or select her and pick a new spot.":"Orain eraman Mabel beste gela batera. — Arrastatu, edo aukeratu eta leku berri bat aukeratu.","Place the Potted Fern, then send it back to the tray with Remove.":"Jarri \"Potted Fern\", eta gero bidali \"Remove\"rekin.","Save the scene whenever you are ready.":"Gorde eszena prest zaudenean.","Good Company":"Konpainia ona.","Two characters in a room can share a heart to heart.":"Bi pertsona gela batean elkartu daitezke.","Place Luna and Biscuit in the same room.":"Luna eta gaileta gela berean.","Make a heart to heart between them.":"Bihotz-bihotzez hitz egin.","Save the scene to finish the lesson.":"Gorde eszenak eskola amaitzeko.","Favorites":"Gogokoenak","Every character has a favorite thing. Signature moments shine brighter.":"Pertsonaia guztiek dute gogokoena. Une bereziak dir-dir egiten dute.","Place Pip and the Old Clock in one room, then make their moment.":"Jarri Pip eta Erlojua gela berean, eta egin une egokia.","That golden glow means a signature moment. Save the scene.":"Urrezko distira horrek une berezia esan nahi du. Gorde eszenatokia.","The Whole House":"Etxe osoa.","Discovery cards are optional goals. The Hint button always suggests a legal next step.":"Aurkikuntza txartelak aukerako helburuak dira. Pista botoiak hurrengo urrats juridikoa adierazten du.","Use Hint if you like, and complete both discovery cards.":"Erabili Aholkua nahi baduzu, eta bete bi aurkikuntza-txartelak.","Lovely. Save the scene — you are ready for the Journey.":"Zoragarria. Gorde eszena — bidaiarako prest zaude.","Create 2 different kinds of story moment.":"Sortu 2 mota desberdinetako istorio momentuak.","First Story":"Lehen istorioa","Save your very first scene.":"Gorde lehen eszena.","Every Kind of Moment":"Une bakoitza.","Trigger all eleven kinds of story beat.":"Hamazazpi istorio mota guztiak piztu.","Three Evenings":"Hiru gau.","Play Storyhouse on three different days.":"Hiru egunetan jolastu Storyhousen.","Mastery Crown":"Maisutasun koroa","Earn three stars on any Mastery stage.":"Irabazi hiru izar edozein masterren.","Curator":"Komisarioa","Collect 25 discovery cards across your saved scenes.":"Bildu 25 aurkikuntza-txartel gorde dituzun eszenetan zehar."}
